sequenceDiagram
    Client->>+API: Request with Authorization
    API->>+AuthorizationMiddleware: Process Request
    AuthorizationMiddleware->>+UserManager: Validate User
    UserManager->>+UserRepository: Get User
    UserRepository-->>-UserManager: User Data
    UserManager->>+RoleManager: Get User Roles
    RoleManager->>+RoleRepository: Fetch Roles
    RoleRepository-->>-RoleManager: Role Data
    RoleManager-->>-UserManager: User Roles
    UserManager-->>-AuthorizationMiddleware: Authorization Result
    AuthorizationMiddleware-->>-API: Allow/Deny
    API-->>-Client: Response (Success/Denied)
